{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id33532794"}, "name":{"label":"Woodrel"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-26T16:28:35-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1625103753"}, "title":{"label":"Finally!"}, "content":{"label":"I moved from Things 2 to 2Do about a year ago because of the dated UI and lack of features. After trying Things 3 for a couple of days I’m back and happy to pay the premium price for this excellent app. It has everything an individual needs in a GTD app, looks great and is a pleasure to use. I hope Cultured Code continue to impove the app so it stays ahead of the competiton. Highly recommended.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id119585499"}, "name":{"label":"dmc1000"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-26T14:17:23-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1625052998"}, "title":{"label":"Simply amazing"}, "content":{"label":"This app is one that can can change your life. So deeply thought out and beautifully executed. It brings calm to the chaos of juggling running a business and having a family. Truly a game changer for anyone serous about getting the right things done and enjoying the process. I love the way it hooks in with reminders on the Apple Watch enabling me to rapidly use Siri to capture things I need to do. So good. I bought the Mac app too and they sync perfectly. Great app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id165744931"}, "name":{"label":"adiwira satwika"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-26T12:30:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1625013648"}, "title":{"label":"Goodbye omniFocus"}, "content":{"label":"Great app guys 👍🏼 i have been using omniFocus for my entire life but switched to things immediately after i saw your app bein more user friendly. I realllly hope that you guys would include an external sync method via dropbox so i could have more privacy! 🙏", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id121814075"}, "name":{"label":"Nick Broadhurst"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-26T04:14:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1624717979"}, "title":{"label":"Brilliant"}, "content":{"label":"I loved Things 2 but this latest version is amazing. As soon as you release repeating tasks in projects I will be a very happy man 😉 Headings are a god send. Checklists I don't use as much because tasks can get burried, but they are still useful. Overall a beautifully executed app that is a life saver for me. Thank you.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id23807010"}, "name":{"label":"canihalveit?"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-26T02:14:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1624622486"}, "title":{"label":"Almost perfect"}, "content":{"label":"Love this new version of things. Really thoughtful improvements. Now, if it enabled collaboration and web access it would be 5 stars for sure...", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id49681736"}, "name":{"label":"Lover of the drums"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-25T16:00:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1624166101"}, "title":{"label":"Best todo app hands down!"}, "content":{"label":"This is a fantastic app. The UI is extraordinary and it has already made me more productive. Thanks for the effort and care you have put into this app!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id126630190"}, "name":{"label":"Xrisr"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-25T14:27:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1624131043"}, "title":{"label":"Significant improvements but expensive"}, "content":{"label":"Being a long-term user of Things I was pleased to see a major upgrade and happy to support the developers, but having to buy separate iPhone, iPad and Mac apps at these \"discounted\" prices is stretching the friendship. Having said that, the new apps have been significantly improved, look great and perform smoothly.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id29253448"}, "name":{"label":"LeMmInG_BoY"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-25T09:32:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1624011164"}, "title":{"label":"Essential Productivity App"}, "content":{"label":"I have been using Things since version 1 and can't imagine life without it. From my daily and scheduled to-dos to recurring items and lists, Things is a powerful app that has never let me down. Creating and scheduling a new task is so quick and effortless with the data immediately synced between my iPhone, iPad and MacBook apps seamlessly.\n\nThe user interface has always been great but I am blown away with how Cultured Code have managed to improve on an already fantastic design in Things 3. I'm loving the new calendar integration that allows me to see my calendars and to-dos all on the same screen! The blue add button is also excellent along with the way in which projects and areas are now displayed.\n\nAll in all, Things is a powerful personal task manager that no productive user should be without.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id42601206"}, "name":{"label":"Seburban"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-25T05:09:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1623830661"}, "title":{"label":"seriously good"}, "content":{"label":"a big new version is tough to get right, and these guys nailed it. i've tried every major task list app on the market - 20 of them at least; this is hands down the best. kudos to culturedcode!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
