{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id127543417"}, "name":{"label":"WinstonJev"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-22T09:12:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1621237637"}, "title":{"label":"Expensive but outstanding."}, "content":{"label":"New version of the app I have used and loved for a VERY long time. Love the clean clear style of this version. Admittedly expensive, especially in conjunction with the desktop app but cost per day use makes it worth the price.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id42122736"}, "name":{"label":"kjdoubleu"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-22T07:27:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1621162385"}, "title":{"label":"Game Changer"}, "content":{"label":"Like many on here, I have chopped and changed task managers / GTD apps over the years and have tried most. Things 3 really has stepped it up. The UI is both gorgeous and powerful beyond any others I have used, OF included. When they say 'desktop quality editing' on mobile, they are right. In the past, apps that are restricted to the Apple ecosystem have been a hassle for me, as I have to use Windows at work. After a few days with Things 3, I am confident I will be able to use it on my iPhone at work (and Mac at home of course) as my full time GTD app. Happy to be back on board.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id138675676"}, "name":{"label":"MarkWAust"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-22T05:00:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1621039784"}, "title":{"label":"Still getting to grips"}, "content":{"label":"I would like tasks to be replicated in the calendar so I can also see them in  fantastical which I use for Calendar", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id38711807"}, "name":{"label":"Tielriffic"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-22T01:26:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1620863445"}, "title":{"label":"Simply Excellent"}, "content":{"label":"I came back to Things earlier this year after a couple of years of frustration with Omnifocus and a brief sojourn to 2Do! I was delighted to find that Things really was by far the best app for my workflow! It's intuitive, quick and easy to learn but more importantly it provided the power and flexibility for me to structure my day and week in a way that best suited my workflow! Things had undergone quite a few improvements in the time I was away and I was really amazed at how good the Things Cloud service was! \n\nI was really excited by the buzz around the new and improved Thing 3 that was released last week! I have found the new features simply excellent! Its a fantastic and really well thought out app! In a nutshell Things doesn't get in the way with useless time wasting complexity, allowing more time to actually get the work done!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
