{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id39598686"}, "name":{"label":"Laggeddot"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-21T18:39:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1620520759"}, "title":{"label":"Goodbye OmniFocus I am back to Things and I love it."}, "content":{"label":"I used Things years ago and moved away because it didn't sync across the various devices and was a bit basic. After trying a few apps I went to OmniFocus. I know so many rave about OmniFocus but it is just too complicated to get anything done and doesn't flow. I have ADD so getting anything done can be overwhelming and unless getting tasks into an app is easy  they don't go in and don't get done. The new Things is beautiful and I am just blown away with its power but also the simplicity of the interface. Love it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
